WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_10h.avi - Ragnarok enters atmosphere
Duration: approximately 7 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
The Ragnarok begins its descent through the upper atmosphere of the planet. The spacecraft's hull glows with heat generated by friction against the thin air. Streaks of light and plasma rush across the hull, creating a brilliant display of orange, yellow, and white as the ship pushes through the atmospheric layers. The planet below fills more and more of the viewport, clouds becoming visible, the surface taking on definition. The transition from the cold, silent void of space to the active, dynamic environment of a planetary atmosphere is marked by this visually striking moment of heat and light.
